      "raw": "Place your bets, folks! How zany is this going to get?\n\nI've got one guess with three sub-guesses: Aminia Twain, pre-Miss Information, dating a supervillain! But which one?\n\nA) Fright Train! He asked her out because he thought her name was Aminia Train. They date for a while, and then the writers take advantage of Vengeance to break them up.\n\nB) Cueball!! They start dating in the Guise book when he tries to rob the Freedom Five HQ, and they hit it off. The main FF writers hate this and ignore it, but the Guise book keeps mentioning it. Years later, there's a book where Cueball refuses to do a job with Miss Information because he misses the old Aminia.\n\nC) Biomancer!!! The nefarious villain disguises himself to date Aminia as part of a sneaky plan, but is surprised to fall for her and monologue about it. A later writer retcons this Biomancer to be a fleshchild that only thought it was in love with Aminia, as part of a complex scheme.",
