      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3991fa700280497d25317f830277d2ed49481c0d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/3991fa700280497d25317f830277d2ed49481c0d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3991fa700280497d25317f830277d2ed49481c0d.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8dhYjwhpPOeDiwdO2i2uaaH05oV\" width=\"646\" height=\"500\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3991fa700280497d25317f830277d2ed49481c0d_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">678×524 94.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I’m unsure whether fans would actually like this or not. On one hand, it could be cute, but on the other she’s a timeless entity older than civilization. Could be upsetting, depending on who they try to have her fall in love with… Naturalist, for example, would be weird.</p>",
