      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-02-10T16:58:19.643Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m going to up you one further, if this was real life comics there would almost certainly be a period where some writer tried to make AZ and Tachyon’s friendship into a romantic thing, either as an ill-fated mainline storyline or more likely in a Disparation story.</p>\n<p>I don’t really think C&amp;A would do this even as kayfabe because it’d hit their ick meter too much, but it’s the sort of thing IRL writers would do.</p>",
