      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-02-11T03:07:22.541Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One, what Fjur noted. As while I can see where you’re coming from with the bisexual thing, I can practically guarantee no writer would ever do it for that reason versus the more bigoted one. (Plus as an RL bi person I wouldn’t want it done for that reason either.)</p>\n<p>Two, C&amp;A have made quite a few comments that indicate AZ &amp; Tachyon’s friendship is an aspect of the lore they’re especially fond/proud of.</p>\n<p>As for “kayfabe”, I’m just indifferent to wrestling myself, but I’ve heard the wrestling fans in the fandom use the term to refer to how C&amp;A handle their “Sentinel Comics is a real company with real comics” shtick and it’s more fitting than any equally snappy term I could come up with so I borrowed it.</p>",
